IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0022.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FRD0022C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 FLAG-REVIEW        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM MINOR-TXN-CHECK
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "FLAG-REVIEW=" FLAG-REVIEW
    STOP RUN.
MINOR-TXN-CHECK.
    IF CUST-AGE LESS THAN 18
       AND TXN-AMT > 9500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FLAG-REVIEW
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    IF TXN-AMT GREATER THAN 50000
       AND COUNTRY-CD EQUAL TO 'XC'
        MOVE 'Y' TO FLAG-REVIEW
        CALL 'FRDALERT' USING INPUT-AREA
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
    END-IF.
